A quote plus after a quote-attached paragraph is a letter

```
> +
q
> +
.
<blockquote>
  <p>q</p>
  <p>+</p>
</blockquote>
```

```
> +
q
> +
r
.
<blockquote>
  <p>q</p>
  <p>+
r</p>
</blockquote>
```

```
> +
q
> +
# h
.
<blockquote>
  <p>q</p>
  <p>+</p>
</blockquote>
<section id="h">
  <h1>h</h1>
</section>
```
